SY_TALK("MueqmxxgY0g",[[3,["Now, any questions?"]],[4,["Question from a yogini: I have a question."]],[5,["Something that I’m encountering in my life,","and I and this guy who I introduced to Sahaja"]],[6,["and we went together."]],[7,["He became very frightened after the first","meeting and he became very much against Sahaja"]],[8,["Shri Mataji: Me?"]],[9,["Yogini: Yes, saying that You were bad."]],[10,["And I, continually I have had great results","with another woman who has experienced."]],[11,["And he, on the contrary is very much against","it and we were involved a lot with channeling"]],[21,["and a spiritual, you know, man that channels","spirits."]],[22,["And I seem to think that he is still involved","with that in some way."]],[23,["I seem to think that is what is holding him","back."]],[24,["Something is holding him and I don’t know","that if it is my place to help him or just"]],[58,["be a light or … I don’t know what to do."]],[70,["Shri Mataji: Now to be very frank, no American","is afraid of anything."]],[102,["Every world is afraid of them."]],[105,["It’s a wrong idea they have."]],[108,["It’s very surprising that the people who","give sense of insecurity to everyone always"]],[116,["say, “I’m insecure.\""]],[117,["Very surprising."]],[118,["That’s the way they can just say."]],[122,["I haven’t met any American who is insecure."]],[128,["On the contrary they are extremely aggressive","people – very, very aggressive for nothing"]],[133,["at all."]],[134,["I’ll give an example."]],[136,["The other day we had gone to one lawyer and","we were waiting for the lift to come down."]],[144,["When the lift came, such a hefty, tall man,","six foot at least seven inches, very hefty"]],[152,["man was in that."]],[154,["And we were standing for the lift to come,","we didn’t know there’s somebody inside"]],[158,["there."]],[159,["As soon as the lift opened, he says, “Who","are you, like a bunch of thugs standing here?”"]],[165,["Can you imagine?"]],[167,["We were amazed."]],[168,["There was no need."]],[170,["He had a chance to say something to us, he","just said it."]],[175,["“So please,” we said."]],[178,["“It’s all right.\""]],[179,["What could you do?"]],[181,["This is the kind of fear they have."]],[187,["Russians and Americans."]],[189,["Both are just the same, I would say."]],[194,["Let them fight it out among themselves."]],[197,["But to say that an American is frightened","of something, that’s the biggest joke."]],[207,["They are not frightened."]],[210,["On the contrary, they always fall into problems","because they go to something which is challenging. I’ll give a [UNCLEAR]"]],[221,["All the false gurus take money from you."]],[226,["All right."]],[228,["Now they say, this one, recently somebody","told Me she paid so much money to the gentleman."]],[237,["He took her into a room all alone."]],[240,["She’s not frightened!"]],[243,["I mean an Indian woman would be frightened","of a man who takes her into a room alone."]],[247,["She says, “No, no, no."]],[249,["You’d better do whatever you like.\""]],[250,["She’s not frightened."]],[251,["She went inside the room."]],[254,["He said, “Now take out your clothes.\""]],[258,["She took out her clothes."]],[261,["Not frightened."]],[262,["He said, “Now you sit here, and jump."]],[265,["Jump, jump, jump!”"]],[266,["She started jumping."]],[268,["Not afraid that she’ll break her bones or","hands or feet or anything."]],[272,["Just started jumping."]],[274,["“Haah!"]],[275,["I feel very fine."]],[276,["I feel very nice.\""]],[278,["What are they afraid of?"]],[280,["Doing stupid things they are not afraid of,","doing nonsensical things they are not afraid"]],[286,["of, but to do sensible things they are."]],[290,["That’s basically wrong thing."]],[293,["You know in Brighton we had a nude, a nude","– what do you call that?"]],[295,["– swimming pool."]],[296,["When it’s such a cold time there."]],[300,["I don’t know why in a country which is so","cold people want to take out their clothes."]],[305,["Some sort of – I can’t understand."]],[307,["I mean in the night we sleep with all our","clothes on in a place like India."]],[312,["What is the need to take out clothes, I still","don’t understand."]],[315,["All right."]],[317,["So, there was a, one swimming pool they started,","a very big venture, you know."]],[326,["All the television, everything focused and","everybody watching, is for the women and men"]],[331,["who become nude."]],[332,["What is so great?"]],[334,["Anybody can become."]],[335,["But, there was an old lady, of My age, walking","into the water."]],[341,["It’s very cold, you know."]],[342,["I was wondering, “This woman will get cold","or something like that and pneumonia.\""]],[346,["They said, “How do you feel?”"]],[348,["“Oh, I feel very hot.\""]],[351,["This stupid woman was feeling hot, you know."]],[357,["This is what it is."]],[359,["“What’s wrong?”"]],[361,["To do something stupid, nonsensical they have","no fear."]],[367,["How is it you think all these gurus have prospered","with all their tricks where people have become"]],[374,["mad, have become lunatics; they’ve lost","their money, sold their children out."]],[381,["How?"]],[382,["For Sahaja Yoga, they’re frightened."]],[384,["Why?"]],[385,["You see the point?"]],[386,["See the point?"]],[387,["This is exact is the character."]],[390,["Such people cannot do Sahaja Yoga."]],[394,["We have to have people of strength, people","of character, people of dignity."]],[400,["We can’t have such people who go after this","thing."]],[404,["Like the other day, one boy came and he asked","Me all stupid questions and he was saying"]],[410,["that, “You see, what about flying in the","air?”"]],[413,["I said, “It’s all right."]],[415,["But supposing you are suddenly dropped down."]],[417,["What will you do?”"]],[418,["He’s willing to fly in the air."]],[422,["Supposing, you see, he has no wings, nothing,","no parachute."]],[427,["How will he come down?"]],[430,["Even the children understand the joke."]],[434,["So this is what it is."]],[436,["To be like a clown, they have no fear at all."]],[442,["But to be sensible, balanced and dignified,","they’re afraid."]],[451,["We are not here to ask for elections, are","we?"]],[461,["Sahaja Yoga is difficult – for people who","are stupid, naturally, people who want to"]],[473,["have a life of destruction."]],[477,["It’s for people who want to evolve, people","who want to become more compassionate, affectionate,"]],[488,["and humble – which is very difficult."]],[497,["Here the training is, if you are humble, anybody","will trample on you, you’ll be finished,"]],[501,["you’ll be killed."]],[502,["All right?"]],[503,["You have to be aggressive."]],[508,["To say an aggressive person is afraid of another","person, then you’d better change the meaning"]],[514,["of the word “aggressive.\""]],[520,["I would not say only Americans, even English."]],[522,["In English language, “I’m afraid.\""]],[524,["What are they afraid?"]],[525,["Everybody is afraid of an Englishman."]],[526,["If he comes in your house, be careful."]],[528,["He’ll create problem between husband and","wife."]],[533,["What is there to be afraid?"]],[540,["Afraid of that is Divine, of that is blissful,","that is"]],[551,["such an advantage to you?"]],[553,["Sahaja Yoga is nothing but blessings, blessings,","blessings."]],[555,["Nothing to sacrifice, nothing to give up,","nothing to sell out."]],[561,["Even small, small things like children, their","problems, this, that is looked into."]],[571,["Somebody who cares for you, Somebody who manages","things, Somebody who makes you powerful and"]],[581,["confident and secure."]],[584,["What is there to be afraid of?"]],[585,["But the brains are upside down."]],[592,["They are not afraid of a tiger, but afraid","of a cow."]],[596,["What do you say to such a person?"]],[601,["Say, “What are you afraid of?”"]],[603,["“Afraid of a cow.\""]],[604,["“And what you’re not afraid of?”"]],[607,["“Not of a tiger.\""]],[609,["“All right."]],[611,["It’s all right."]],[613,["Sorry."]],[614,["I’ll go to some other place.\""]],[615,["That’s what you have to say."]],[616,["I mean, this is what it is: people are just","upside down."]],[621,["Their value system is upside down."]],[625,["Example I’ll give you, very simple example,","this Mr."]],[628,["Hart lost his election because they said he","had some relationship with some woman somewhere."]],[635,["It’s so common in this country."]],[637,["What is there that he should lose?"]],[640,["I mean, if he had done something else, like","if he had taken some money of the government"]],[646,["or must have cheated them, then it’s all","right."]],[648,["But on a point which everybody does!"]],[651,["It would be tomorrow, “Why did you eat a","sausage?"]],[654,["That’s why it lose you.\""]],[658,["It’s absurd."]],[659,["They’re upside down."]],[660,["Brains are upside down."]],[663,["See, what is the logic?"]],[664,["So those who say they’re afraid, you say,","“You’re right."]],[668,["You go and bang your head with something."]],[671,["That would be better for you.\""]],[673,["It’s all stories, I tell you, is the way","they put you down."]],[679,["There’s nothing to be afraid from a fragrance","of the flower – it’s like that."]],[689,["There’s … we have a guru who cannot bear","any flowers."]],[692,["No fragrance."]],[694,["But if you take the water from the gutters,","he’s very happy."]],[698,["Now, what do you say to that?"]],[701,["I mean we are not here to please such people,","are we?"]],[704,["You know there’s a guru like that."]],[706,["He can’t bear … He got how many Rolls","Royces?"]],[709,["Sixty-three Rolls Royces."]],[711,["And they used to take gutter water for him,","instead of giving flowers."]],[717,["And there are many Americans who did it, thousands","and thousands and thousands."]],[725,["Imagine, to buy sixty-three Rolls Royces out","of American money."]],[730,["What do you say to them?"]],[734,["But they’re afraid to come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[744,["See?"]],[746,["This is self-deception."]],[749,["There’s nothing hiding in Sahaja Yoga."]],[751,["We have to say what one has to say."]],[754,["We have to face what one has to face."]],[757,["You should not have any conditionings about","it."]],[760,["You should not have any ego about it."]],[762,["Try to understand that this has to be understood:","that we have to be ourselves."]],[769,["We have to grow."]],[771,["Whatever is wrong within us has to go away."]],[774,["But it’s only possible when you become the","Self."]],[777,["Like, if I have something wrong on My sari,","I can only see it if I have eyes, otherwise"]],[782,["anybody says, “You’re wearing a sari which","is dirty”, I might be angry."]],[785,["If I’m identified with the sari, I’ll","be angry."]],[790,["But if I see, “Oh God!"]],[792,["I’d better clean it.\""]],[793,["So it’s a vicious circle how to open their","eyes, because to open their eyes is very difficult,"]],[800,["impossible, because they are afraid."]],[804,["They’re afraid of the light, happy with","the darkness."]],[808,["Now you cannot please them."]],[812,["Also, you must know that if you put the whole","American people together and all the Western"]],[824,["people together, we have manifold more people","say in India and other countries who will"]],[834,["become realized souls."]],[835,["God doesn’t bother from where they come."]],[839,["If they want to accept such horrible gurus,","let them have it and go with them."]],[848,["As they say, “Take two running jumps and","go to Hell!”"]],[851,["That’s the attitude of the Divine, I really","tell you."]],[856,["But not Mine, because I am the Mother so I","have to make the compromise between the nonsensical"]],[864,["people and the Divine, which is nothing but","sense."]],[870,["There, that is common sense."]],[875,["So what I have to do is to: “All right."]],[877,["Doesn’t matter."]],[878,["Let’s try."]],[879,["Let’s try."]],[880,["They’ll come along."]],[881,["They’ll be all right."]],[882,["They are created by God, that’s why they","are loved.\""]],[884,["But not because you are seeking any elections."]],[887,["You must realize it."]],[891,["We are not the only human beings living."]],[894,["We are not the topmost people."]],[897,["Let’s see where we have gone."]],[902,["I don’t want to condemn anyone as such,","because they are all My children, but I would"]],[907,["like you to see where are we."]],[910,["We must understand, we are getting destroyed,","our children are getting destroyed, our society"]],[915,["is getting destroyed, the whole thing is getting","destroyed."]],[917,["Where are we?"]],[918,["What’s the use of calling ourselves great?"]],[920,["Now AIDS, you’ll be surprised, there’s","a war on AIDS – what is the war on AIDS?"]],[929,["Once upon a time, you see, these tourists","used to bring their clothes and their, what"]],[942,["you call, sleeping bags and everything, and","sell them in the border of Nepal."]],[949,["My daughter lives there."]],[955,["Once they got the news of AIDS, not that they","don’t purchase this, but they’ve thrown"]],[960,["everything, whatever they had in the house","and burnt it up."]],[964,["This is the situation."]],[968,["Nobody wants to kiss an American these days,","to be very frank."]],[973,["I’ve been warned."]],[977,["That’s what you are."]],[979,["That’s what we are going."]],[980,["Let’s see where are we going, relatively."]],[983,["But we think still we are great."]],[987,["Then who can help you?"]],[990,["You are just holding on now to something."]],[996,["Any moment you’ll fall down."]],[998,["Supposing that is the situation, then try","to understand you are in a difficult situation."]],[1003,["I want to warn you again, just like Vishnumaya,","be – not only that you should understand,"]],[1013,["but be in possession of this understanding","that we have to save others."]],[1021,["If they are afraid, tell them, “What are","you afraid of, stupid fellow?"]],[1028,["Come along.\""]],[1030,["They like it, I tell you."]],[1035,["“But I am afraid …”"]],[1036,["Then you also very sophisticatedly say, “Oh,","I am sorry you are afraid."]],[1039,["What are you afraid of?”"]],[1041,["All right?"]],[1043,["That’s how it will work."]],[1045,["Otherwise it is not going to work out."]],[1050,["I’ve tried all tricks."]],[1052,["Nothing works out unless you tell them, “Better","join Sahaja Yoga otherwise you’ll be destroyed"]],[1057,["tomorrow."]],[1058,["You’ll get cancer, you’ll get AIDS, you’ll","get this."]],[1060,["If you want to save yourself, come to Sahaja","Yoga.\""]],[1064,["That’s what they understand, and that’s","what the gurus do to them."]],[1067,["“If you do not jump, I’ll throw you out","of the room.\""]],[1069,["So they start jumping."]],[1071,["It’s a fact."]],[1075,["Till they break their bones, they jump."]],[1083,["So you should know that you’re Sahaja Yogis","and that you are building up a new society"]],[1093,["of people who can save others."]],[1096,["For that you have to know how far people have","gone, how you have to pull them out, how you"]],[1102,["have to work it out."]],[1104,["Any style of compromise, any style of explanation,","discussion – try everything, because after"]],[1118,["all, I don’t want them to be destroyed."]],[1121,["But don’t think what they say has any sense","in it."]],[1128,["You must have a higher understanding than","they are because you know that they are catching"]],[1133,["on the Agnya and they are afraid."]],[1136,["All right?"]],[1137,["Some of them do say – I’ve heard – that,","“Supposing we get transformed, then we cannot"]],[1146,["enjoy the life of every day life.\""]],[1150,["What are you enjoying?"]],[1151,["On the road you are walking, when I came in","Los Angeles, they told Me, “Mother, do You"]],[1158,["know, serious things have happened.\""]],[1160,["I said, “What serious things?”"]],[1163,["“On this road three people were killed last","week.\""]],[1168,["I said, “How?”"]],[1170,["“Just they shot.\""]],[1171,["“What’s so great about us?”, you should","ask."]],[1177,["“Aren’t you worried about this may happen","to you – to happen to your children?"]],[1182,["They’ll be killed."]],[1184,["Anybody can kill you."]],[1185,["What are you doing about it?”"]],[1187,["Talk like that as if you understand the problem."]],[1195,["You express your concern, your heartfelt concern."]],[1202,["Definitely they will understand."]],[1206,["Because they told Me that “In Sahaja Yoga","it’s very bad because we’ll be transformed"]],[1210,["and then we’ll not enjoy.\""]],[1213,["So this is what you’re enjoying on the street","– go ahead."]],[1218,["Enjoy the fear, the scariness of it."]],[1221,["You can’t make your children play in the","front door."]],[1227,["That’s what you’re enjoying?"]],[1232,["They enjoy, if they’re stupid they say,","“We … this is our fundamental right to"]],[1236,["be stupid.\""]],[1238,["But you have a fundamental right to enjoy","joy, to meet joy."]],[1242,["Have you met joy?"]],[1245,["That’s your fundamental right: to be the","Spirit."]],[1248,["Have you become the Spirit?"]],[1251,["It’s fundamental right – what sort of","a fundamental right it is to be stupid?"]],[1257,["And they say it openly, shamelessly, without","any respect of yourself."]],[1263,["They have no respect of themselves, so they","have to first have their own respect."]],[1269,["For that, they have to understand that they’re","human beings at the epitome of evolution."]],[1274,["They don’t have to become worms now anymore."]],[1278,["All this you can talk to them the way I’m","talking to you, all of you, and tell them,"]],[1282,["“See, now this is what it is."]],[1284,["What is happening?"]],[1285,["What are we doing about it?”"]],[1287,["All right?"]],[1288,["Even then if they say so, all right."]],[1292,["Don’t waste your energy."]],[1294,["We have to work it out together."]],[1304,["Try any tricks that are possible; you are","permitted."]],[1310,["But in Sahaj Yoga there’s no need to tell","lies, no need to do any harm, to torture someone."]],[1320,["There’s no need at all."]],[1323,["But better bring to their understanding, in","their vision, what is going to happen to the"]],[1336,["country."]],[1337,["That’s your job as Sahaj Yogis."]],[1338,["I don’t want anything from you, as you know."]],[1341,["But, you have to understand that Mother has","given us realization, that we have become"]],[1349,["Sahaj Yogis – for what?"]],[1353,["We have become Sahaja Yogis to be the light,","to show them the light, show them the darkness,"]],[1358,["show them the way they will fall down and","will be destroyed."]],[1363,["That’s our job."]],[1364,["All right?"]],[1365,["May God bless you."]],[1366,["Any other question, please?"]],[1367,["Question from a Yogi: I was wondering if You","could talk about what we could do to form"]],[1368,["a school for our children here in America."]],[1378,["Many of us now with small children [???????]"]],[1390,["Shri Mataji: That has been My primal problem","here."]],[1396,["I know, it’s terrible, I know!"]],[1398,["You see it’s going to be very difficult","for you to have your children sent to these"]],[1403,["schools because the atmosphere is so bad."]],[1408,["For the time being I only feel that you must","develop your children in such a manner that"]],[1417,["they become strong, self-confident, and also","they have good examples before them, as you"]],[1426,["people are – to begin with."]],[1428,["And you will find many Indian families are","here, but what I have seen is that the children"]],[1437,["of at least sixty percent of Indian families","don’t learn bad things, normally."]],[1445,["This is My own experience."]],[1449,["The reason is because the Indian family people","are all the time talking to their children,"]],[1455,["having a nice family meetings together, taking","them out, telling them about good things,"]],[1463,["of sharing; because those people who are here","from India have had that kind of a training,"]],[1471,["so they are trying to train their children","in the same way."]],[1476,["Now the families which are so-called “advanced”","here can beat you hollow in nonsensical things."]],[1484,["Because when it comes to advancement, they","don’t know how to relate it to anything"]],[1489,["else."]],[1490,["But those who are not that way, those who","have been going through a lifestyle, still"]],[1501,["maintain their own ideas and their own behavior,","their own principles."]],[1512,["They are imbibed by children, and they just","think, “These are another category of people;"]],[1519,["these are not our style, these are different.\""]],[1524,["They don’t change."]],[1526,["I’ve seen many families like that."]],[1529,["In the same way, first of all you must pay","full attention to your children, talk to them,"]],[1534,["bring them up in such a manner that they have","another value system."]],[1541,["I mean, I can say about My own daughters or","grandchildren, you put them anywhere in the"]],[1547,["world, they will never become like others,","because they have their roots."]],[1553,["So you must try to make their roots very strong","into great principles."]],[1560,["Then they won’t be that much in difficulty."]],[1570,["Like as I was discussing today … people","that … see the … as I said that Indian"]],[1579,["society has built up itself in traditional","… now ages it has built in traditions and"]],[1587,["things."]],[1588,["So it must have made mistakes, trial and error","and all that."]],[1592,["But it has reached certain really some very","fine points."]],[1596,["One thing about children in India, say, we","don’t tell them, “Don’t touch this!"]],[1603,["Don’t take this!"]],[1606,["Don’t open this!”"]],[1608,["Never."]],[1609,["We also don’t allow them just to behave","like a bull in a china shop."]],[1615,["Supposing now I want to have a Diet Coke."]],[1617,["All right?"]],[1618,["So I tell a child, “All right, go and get","one tin of Diet."]],[1624,["Now bring this glass."]],[1626,["Slowly, because it is very good, so beautiful,","you have to use it very carefully."]],[1633,["Now keep it there."]],[1635,["Now open the can."]],[1637,["Put it in there."]],[1638,["Now you have bring it and give it to a friend","or anyone.\""]],[1642,["So the child carries it very carefully."]],[1646,["But supposing it falls down, doesn’t matter!"]],[1649,["He’ll have another one."]],[1651,["So the child develops the deftness of handling","it, the respect for it, and not the sort of"]],[1661,["a fear of it."]],[1665,["The cooking, same way."]],[1667,["Today there was a big complaint about the","way people cook here."]],[1672,["And in the discussion then I reached a conclusion","that the mother cooks that way."]],[1684,["So what mothers says, all right, she … the","child doesn’t sit in the TV room if mother"]],[1691,["is cooking, in Indian homes."]],[1692,["Is the child is in the TV room?"]],[1695,["No, is with the mother."]],[1697,["The mother says, “All right."]],[1699,["Now what you do, we’ll cut some vegetables."]],[1702,["I’m cutting."]],[1703,["Now you’d better do it."]],[1704,["Now whatever is left out, which is not to","be used for cooking, we’ll have to put it"]],[1707,["in this thing."]],[1708,["Now, this has to go into the wastepaper basket.\""]],[1712,["And Indian kitchen is all the time clean,","spic and span, every minute."]],[1718,["Every room is spic and span."]],[1721,["House."]],[1722,["Outside, what can we do?"]],[1723,["It’s the government, the management nonsense."]],[1726,["I mean the people here think they’re very","clean; I think they are not, only the government"]],[1730,["is."]],[1735,["The clothes are hanging here – this, that."]],[1737,["In Indian homes, even in the poorest of poor","you go, everything looks spic and span, clean."]],[1743,["Because the child is told to keep it."]],[1745,["Now the child has, say, a paper in his hand."]],[1749,["He won’t throw it everywhere."]],[1751,["Carry it, take it to the … How?"]],[1754,["because the mother will say, “All right,","now this paper is here."]],[1757,["Where should it go?”"]],[1759,["All the time the mother and the child are","together, or the father."]],[1763,["All the time."]],[1764,["Wherever."]],[1765,["It’s not that the children can’t go to","this place."]],[1768,["Here the beginning itself is wrong."]],[1770,["When the little child is born, you put him","in another room and the parents are sleeping"]],[1773,["in another room."]],[1775,["It’s the worse thing that you can do to","a little baby."]],[1779,["That’s how the child will become very insecure,","unhappy, abnormal."]],[1785,["In the subconscious, the child will have a","very funny feelings."]],[1797,["After marriage, after having children the","parents have to accept parenthood."]],[1801,["They are still in the bridal dresses, or the","men are still thinking they are romantic heroes"]],[1810,["going around."]],[1811,["You are parents now!"]],[1812,["Otherwise don’t produce children."]],[1813,["If you produce children, be parents."]],[1817,["That doesn’t mean you should become absolutely","boring type people."]],[1823,["But, take interest in your children; keep","them with you all the time; talk to them;"]],[1829,["tell them how to behave."]],[1831,["I mean the behavior here of children is abnormally","funny I find."]],[1837,["For that, one has to blame the training."]],[1845,["And all the freedom is to be given to children."]],[1848,["Now the carpet is more important than child;","a door is more important, wall is more important"]],[1854,["than the child."]],[1855,["Then what happens, when the children grow","up I’ve seen, when they go to somebody’s"]],[1859,["house they start using everything as if their","own."]],[1862,["In their house they are very comfortably seated."]],[1868,["And also every way you have restrictions on","children, which sometimes shocks."]],[1875,["Like I’ll tell you the example of My own","granddaughter, she was telling Me that “Naani,"]],[1880,["I’d invited some girls for my birthday party."]],[1884,["And you know they liked it very much."]],[1887,["And she asked me, ‘Can I have some more?’"]],[1890,["I was surprised."]],[1891,["It was all Mummy had made for them, and she","had such a lot inside, and she was enjoying,"]],[1896,["they were eating."]],[1897,["So they came and asked, ‘Can I have for","some more?’"]],[1900,["They’re not beggars; they are children."]],[1905,["They should rule all their wants."]],[1908,["They should ask for."]],[1910,["But then you’ll get some toys, put them,","the toy is with the child."]],[1914,["The child doesn’t know the parents."]],[1917,["Toys, fill it up with the toys."]],[1919,["Then by the time you go in the garage, there’s","no place."]],[1923,["All the toys are kept there, you see."]],[1931,["So the whole training system is wrong."]],[1935,["You must take your child with you."]],[1937,["You must take him out."]],[1938,["You must show everything."]],[1940,["Who else is going to teach them?"]],[1943,["I see a mother who is, say, a person who has","done, say, M.A."]],[1948,["in Botany, and the child doesn’t know what","is a leaf and what is a flower."]],[1955,["Involve them with yourself."]],[1959,["You go to work, tell them what happened, “You","know, today this thing happened in the work,"]],[1964,["this is what.\""]],[1965,["They are something separate from you."]],[1966,["How can they grow?"]],[1969,["At this time, they depend on you for all their","nourishment."]],[1973,["Every time."]],[1974,["And in that you have to teach them how to","share things."]],[1981,["But I think very little time is spent with","children, which should be much more – much,"]],[1986,["much more."]],[1987,["Continuously it should be."]],[1989,["I mean even My girls who are – one is forty","years of age, even now she comes and sleeps"]],[1995,["with Me in the morning time."]],[1997,["She must hug Me, sleep with Me; and when I","come, she cries like a little baby, what to"]],[2004,["do?"]],[2005,["I did the same with My mother."]],[2008,["But I knew everything about My mother, and","I knew so many things that she liked and what"]],[2013,["she didn’t like and what should not be done."]],[2015,["And there’s such an attachment to the mother","comes in, and father."]],[2020,["You don’t want to lose that love."]],[2024,["Once My daughter asked Me, when she was in","college, “I want to wear sleeveless blouses.\""]],[2030,["I said, “Go ahead."]],[2032,["No harm”"]],[2033,["She said, “But why don’t You wear?”"]],[2034,["I said, “I feel shy."]],[2035,["I feel shy to expose My arms.\""]],[2037,["Then she said immediately, “Then this is","no criteria – because I’ve asked You,"]],[2043,["You should say ‘yes’ to me?"]],[2044,["No, that’s not good.\""]],[2047,["She, herself, corrected herself."]],[2054,["So first a complete integration of the children","with yourself."]],[2059,["Now, the films – they have films for children,","for adolescents then I don’t know what else"]],[2065,["is there."]],[2066,["No, all the films should be for everyone."]],[2071,["But if you have to show filthy stuff, then","you have to have it after twelve o’clock"]],[2075,["in the night."]],[2078,["Why to see filthy stuff?"]],[2082,["Whatever you’re children cannot see, why","should you see?"]],[2086,["It’s not something very mature, is it, that","you want to see and the children can’t see."]],[2100,["So the whole shifting starts, like a mother","is seeing the very mature thing is about God,"]],[2107,["is about some great Incarnation, of some philosophy."]],[2111,["Children are also sitting."]],[2113,["And they start asking, “What is collective","consciousness?” at a very young age."]],[2119,["“What is Chaitanya?"]],[2121,["What is Omkara?”"]],[2122,["The whole attention moves to something else."]],[2124,["Otherwise you show them the thing for the","children in that they show you this doll coming"]],[2130,["today, that doll."]],[2131,["“Mommy, I must have that doll!”"]],[2134,["Get them the doll and be finished with them."]],[2138,["That’s wonderful."]],[2139,["Bring their attention out of all these things."]],[2141,["See these all medias, everything, are working","on your children morning till evening."]],[2147,["Now they have a doll in America which even","have a birth date."]],[2152,["And then you have to join a club, and for","that club you have to pay so much, so much"]],[2158,["dollars."]],[2159,["Then you become a member of that, and they","write to you, “What is the name for the"]],[2166,["child and when was she christened, and this","and that.\""]],[2172,["They are playing upon your children."]],[2176,["And you are happy as long as children don’t","trouble you, and when they trouble you in"]],[2182,["England – I don’t know in America what","do they do – they kill their children."]],[2186,["Then the children kill them."]],[2189,["Whole thing is upside down."]],[2194,["India it might happen if they become developed","and advanced."]],[2204,["So we are different people; we come out of","it."]],[2207,["Now let’s start another way."]],[2210,["Let’s not identify ourselves with that nonsense."]],[2212,["Let’s be something extraordinary."]],[2216,["Let’s make our children something different."]],[2221,["That’s what is to be given to your children,","not money, wealth, toys."]],[2228,["No!"]],[2230,["Personality."]],[2231,["Roots."]],[2232,["You are their roots."]],[2234,["If you are shifty like this, how do you expect","your children to be all right?"]],[2240,["You have to nourish them."]],[2243,["All right?"]],[2245,["So first of all, the education of the child","starts with the father, mother and the family"]],[2252,["– and the respect for elders."]],[2254,["Supposing your father is there, your mother","is in the house, and if you will ill treat"]],[2260,["your parents, they will ill treat you, naturally."]],[2266,["There is a very interesting story: There was","an old lady and she had a father-in-law who"]],[2275,["was very old, and the son always used to carry","his broth in a bowl made of ordinary clay."]],[2284,["And she used to treat him like a dog, the","daughter-in-law."]],[2289,["One day that broke, and this boy fell down","and it broke and he started crying."]],[2297,["So the mother thought he’s very badly hurt","the way he was crying."]],[2300,["He said, “No, I am not hurt, but this thing","is broken.\""]],[2303,["“So why are you crying for that?"]],[2305,["We can get another one.\""]],[2306,["“Sure you can get another one?”"]],[2308,["She said, “Yes.\""]],[2309,["“You know because I was worried how will","I give you food when you will be old."]],[2318,["That’s what I was worried, that when I have","to send you food, how will I manage?”"]],[2327,["Then she understood."]],[2333,["How you treat others, how you behave towards","others, how you live neatly, clean ways and"]],[2340,["things – that’s what children learn."]],[2344,["Greatest thing, more than precepts, are practices."]],[2350,["Here the husband, wife will quarrel in the","presence of children, beat each other."]],[2355,["Can you imagine?"]],[2358,["I’ve seen that."]],[2361,["I mean if you see any film these days, it’s","the quarrel between husband and wife – put"]],[2364,["this way, that way, that way, this way, this","way, that way."]],[2367,["That’s all, get fed up with it."]],[2371,["No respect, no love, no affection."]],[2377,["Or some sort of a destruction."]],[2380,["Then the children, themselves, don’t want","to see any picture."]],[2386,["You see, when My daughters were small, I would","only take them to religious picture like Shri"]],[2392,["Rama’s life, this, that, and all that."]],[2394,["So they developed a taste for that."]],[2396,["So when they went home to My mother’s place","they said, “We will not go to this picture."]],[2401,["If there is any Ramas, Hanumanas, then we’ll","go.\""]],[2405,["So My sister said, “You see, first of all","we can’t leave them alone in the house."]],[2411,["You can’t take them to any picture, they","don’t like any other picture but that of"]],[2415,["God’s pictures."]],[2416,["So, I mean there are not so many, so what","to do?”"]],[2420,["I said, “All right, why don’t you also","see with them the same?”"]],[2423,["She said, “But there are some nice social","pictures, but they don’t like it.\""]],[2432,["So what sort of books you give them, what","sort of things you talk to them – always"]],[2438,["be with them, keep them with you."]],[2440,["That’s the best."]],[2441,["Or even if they have to go to some school,","it should be a school where there’s love,"]],[2445,["affection, good company, they talk of Sahaj","Yoga, sort of a thing."]],[2450,["I wish you could start a school of Sahaja","Yoga in America."]],[2455,["But you know how difficult it is to start","anything sensible?"]],[2458,["Everybody is afraid."]],[2461,["But if you want to start a school of nonsensical","things, they’ll give you grants."]],[2467,["It’s very difficult, even in England – same","thing, can’t start a school."]],[2473,["If you want to start some sort of a disco,","it’s very easy."]],[2482,["Many schools are closing down in England."]],[2486,["Actually, there was a school for sale."]],[2491,["I wanted to buy in My own simple ideas."]],[2494,["They said, “Mother, first think why it is","closed.\""]],[2498,["I said, “Why?”"]],[2499,["“Because of the different rules and regulations,","it is closed.\""]],[2502,["I said, “Then, you’re great grandchildren","might be able to go to that school."]],[2512,["It will take so much time.\""]],[2517,["So first thing I’ll say, you should look","after your children."]],[2520,["Tell them when it is wrong, you must tell","them, “This is wrong, it should not be done.\""]],[2525,["Like your child doesn’t respect others,","you must tell them."]],[2530,["If he doesn’t do, if he spoils something","or does something wrong to others, then you"]],[2538,["must tell him."]],[2539,["If he doesn’t share things, you must tell,","“You must share your doll."]],[2544,["You must share this.\""]],[2546,["But when it comes to correcting him for nonsensical","things, you should not."]],[2554,["You’ll see, it will change."]],[2556,["Then later on, of course, we have to think","of school and all that, trying to do something."]],[2561,["Let’s work it out, maybe, then we’ll take","over."]],[2567,["Basically they should be all right."]],[2568,["Otherwise, they come to India and slap all","the teachers."]],[2571,["What’s the use?"]],[2573,["It’s not easy."]],[2574,["Western children are not easy, you know, to","manage."]],[2578,["Actually, then definitely they’ll be frightened","of western children coming to India – rather"]],[2589,["difficult."]],[2592,["Because you must discipline them."]],[2594,["And the main thing is, they should like the","discipline, they should want the discipline."]],[2600,["That’s how you should be."]],[2603,["This stupid idea of freedom, means license,","should go out."]],[2607,["They should like it."]],[2609,["I remember My parents, the way they disciplined","us, we would like it."]],[2619,["Any child would remember that, “Oh my father,","very particular.\""]],[2626,["But here they’ll call a twelve-year-old","son – I know a friend of ours, such a shocking"]],[2631,["story!"]],[2632,["The lady come to -friend means in the official","way."]],[2636,["She came to London and she said, “Have you","seen the pubs?”"]],[2640,["I said, “No.\""]],[2642,["“Wonderful, interesting pubs in London.\""]],[2644,["I said, “Really?”"]],[2646,["She had a list of them."]],[2648,["She said, “The best is this one.\""]],[2651,["I said, “What is so special?”"]],[2652,["“It’s called as the Hermit’s Pub.\""]],[2656,["“So what is great?”"]],[2658,["“You see, a man died in this place, and","people did not know for months together."]],[2665,["Then the smell started coming out, so they","came in, took him away and buried him."]],[2672,["But all the cobwebs and all the smell is still","retained."]],[2677,["And that’s the most expensive pub in London.\""]],[2681,["I said, “Oh God."]],[2683,["What’s this going on?”"]],[2685,["This lady said, “You know, we are very free","with our children."]],[2692,["We allow them to do what they like.\""]],[2694,["And she had two sons, I think – one was","twelve-year-old and one was eleven-year-old."]],[2700,["And these husband, wife were sleeping upstairs,","in America."]],[2704,["These two children were having a party, and","the father had given them alcohol, beer, all"]],[2712,["open drink."]],[2713,["“Oh, enjoy, we are one!”"]],[2718,["And these children of that age group started","drinking, and then I don’t know what happened"]],[2723,["to them, they put fire to some alcohol and","the whole house was burnt."]],[2728,["One child ran out, eleven-year-old."]],[2731,["The mother, father, one son all died and so","many children."]],[2737,["This is no freedom."]],[2745,["You have to teach your children discretion;","you have to teach them."]],[2753,["This is what one has to learn."]],[2756,["So I think before starting a school for children,","let us start a school for parents."]],[2760,["What do you say?"]],[2761,["All right."]],[2762,["What is next?"]],[2763,["Ursula: Shri Mataji, You had suggested that","we can try many tricks, or different tricks"]],[2773,["for approaching seekers to find our brothers","and sisters."]],[2786,["And in Australia, when someone has …"]],[2788,["Shri Mataji: No, no, no."]],[2789,["I can’t hear you."]],[2790,["Just come here."]],[2791,["Yes, Ursula."]],[2792,["What is it?"]],[2793,["Ursula: You had suggested that we could try","many tricks to find our brothers and sisters,"]],[2802,["and different ways and approaches."]],[2805,["And in Australia, each idea seems to be … they’re","so enthusiastic and they, they support the"]],[2815,["idea."]],[2816,["And this is, I don’t know if it’s just","my feeling, but there’s a feeling here that"]],[2831,["when there’s a suggestion or an idea we’re","very “Oh, no.\""]],[2834,["One person may say, “Yes, good idea.\""]],[2836,["Another person may say “No, no.\""]],[2837,["And then you don’t want to do anything wrong,","so you just don’t do anything, you just"]],[2840,["wait."]],[2841,["And then nothing happens."]],[2842,["Shri Mataji: Among Sahaj Yogis, you mean to","say?"]],[2843,["Ursula: Among Sahaj Yogis."]],[2844,["Shri Mataji: See, it comes from the individualistic","attitude about ourselves."]],[2847,["I mean anything you tell them, they cannot","live collectively, that we know in the West."]],[2853,["I know what I have to go through when we have","to organize their programs with three hundred"]],[2858,["people coming, this and that."]],[2861,["But … this individualism is so much, like","every bathroom has a different tap."]],[2875,["You’d better ask somebody, otherwise you’ll","land up into difficulties."]],[2879,["Even the ties have to be different; everything","has to be different."]],[2887,["Now, if there’s something fundamental, then","you can ask your leader."]],[2894,["But if it is something mundane, all right."]],[2895,["You want blue color?"]],[2896,["I have blue."]],[2897,["You want red?"]],[2899,["Have red."]],[2900,["Like that you can solve your problem."]],[2903,["If it is something fundamental, then you should","ask your leader."]],[2907,["But if it is something which is not fundamental,","which is very simple, let them have their"]],[2919,["own way, then gradually they’ll grow into","it."]],[2921,["Because this is the basic problem of this","country is."]],[2925,["So-called individualism makes them feel that,","“Oh, this mine."]],[2928,["I’ll do it the way I like.\""]],[2931,["Now say a motor car has a different handle."]],[2934,["Now a person who’s sitting inside must know","what sort of a handle it is."]],[2939,["Tomorrow something happens, you can’t even","open it."]],[2942,["Otherwise, they’re not at all individualistic,","I’ll tell you how."]],[2947,["Like in India, supposing I’m wearing this","sari."]],[2950,["Maybe there’s another sari like that."]],[2952,["If another lady’s wearing the same sari,","she’ll go and change and come back."]],[2957,["She won’t wear the same sari."]],[2959,["But, here when fashion, if somebody’s … now","that our Princess of Wales has this kind of"]],[2966,["a hairstyle, all English girl’s have the","same hairstyle."]],[2970,["You don’t know from one to another."]],[2973,["So what is so individual about them?"]],[2976,["If some fashion starts, now this is the fashion,","very fashionable."]],[2980,["What is fashionable?"]],[2981,["Is to cut your hair this way and make a punk."]],[2985,["So everybody is a punk."]],[2987,["Suddenly you find Sahaja Yogis walking as","punks, you want to know who is who."]],[2992,["So what is the individual character there?"]],[2996,["Where is the individuality?"]],[2998,["On principles you should be individuals – on","principles, and not on artificial things."]],[3005,["Now this one has a principle."]],[3007,["Supposing I’m wearing this sari."]],[3010,["It’s made by hand, it’s one designed by","one person."]],[3016,["So I’m giving importance to one person."]],[3018,["Now he might have made two or three or four","at the most."]],[3022,["Now if somebody repeats the same sari, that","means I have not encouraged that man so much."]],[3032,["Like you can have the same sari made out of","a, say, machine."]],[3037,["Then you’ll start, “All right have ten","saris like this, twenty saris like this, all"]],[3043,["made by machines.\""]],[3045,["But here, because we want to have a sari separate,","it has to be made with hand."]],[3051,["In principle, see?"]],[3054,["How it helps!"]],[3058,["This is what it is."]],[3064,["In principle you should be collective; in","principle you should be individualistic."]],[3068,["In Sahaja Yoga we don’t want you dressed","up the same way."]],[3073,["I mean I don’t want Americans to go about","like something Chinese."]],[3077,["Let us have our own dress, dress up the way","we like, everything."]],[3084,["That’s all right."]],[3086,["It’s nothing important."]],[3088,["But in principle, we have to be the same."]],[3091,["One principle nourishes the tree – the sap."]],[3098,["It has many flowers, fruits."]],[3100,["It has many leaves, it’s all right – outside."]],[3104,["So in principle you have to be collective."]],[3106,["All right?"]],[3108,["For mundane things, why to fight?"]],[3114,["But in any case, somebody who is an elder,","who knows better, who’s wiser – listen"]],[3126,["to that person."]],[3129,["We always have an awe, and a respect for elders."]],[3134,["Like I see, thank God, you have now Sherayu,","supposing – take one case, individual case."]],[3139,["She’s come all the way from India, now she’s","staying."]],[3143,["She knows quite a lot about pujas, things","like that."]],[3146,["She knows how to do many things."]],[3150,["You should be prepared to know from her."]],[3153,["Otherwise sometimes it’s very embarrassing","the way things happen."]],[3155,["Now she’s here, she can teach you."]],[3157,["There’s nothing wrong in learning."]],[3159,["She has learned many things from you."]],[3161,["But there’s no respect, I think sometimes,","for her, at all."]],[3164,["She’s an auntie somewhere sitting on the","shelf."]],[3166,["No, she’s here for a purpose, one should","learn, respect."]],[3168,["But that doesn’t mean you be her slave or","anything, but you gain something out of her."]],[3176,["Another person who comes here should learn."]],[3179,["Like from Americans, we have to learn a lot."]],[3182,["Tell Me what."]],[3184,["Yogini: I don’t think we’re doing much","about communication."]],[3190,["Shri Mataji: The communication is not there","because of individualism."]],[3194,["But, that’s not so."]],[3196,["There’s no individualism at all, because","I’ve seen, once the fashion starts, everybody"]],[3202,["looks the same."]],[3203,["The other day I came, I saw ladies looking","like men with muscles like this, walking like"]],[3209,["that."]],[3210,["I said, “What sort of creature is this?”"]],[3211,["One came, two came, three came, five came,","ten came."]],[3215,["“What’s this going on?”"]],[3217,["I didn’t understand."]],[3218,["They are all walking like that, like Draculas."]],[3221,["I said, “What is this?”"]],[3224,["“Oh, this is fashionable.\""]],[3225,["What is fashionable?"]],[3226,["“They’re developing their muscles.\""]],[3228,["What’s the principle?"]],[3232,["(continued on second cassette)"]],[3237,["That’s it."]],[3239,["So, in such things we do not argue."]],[3243,["Means in stupidity we don’t argue, but in","sensible things we argue."]],[3249,["In sensible things – we have to understand","what is sensible."]],[3252,["After all, we are realized souls; we are not","like other people."]],[3257,["We must understand what is good."]],[3259,["When I say something, you agree."]],[3261,["I don’t know how."]],[3265,["You like it."]],[3266,["I may say something also which may not be","so palatable, but you like it."]],[3270,["See, think must have it, it’s a medicine."]],[3274,["In the same way, one should see to things","which you may not like so much, because maybe"]],[3281,["you’re conditioned, but see to the sense","of it, the common sense, the balance."]],[3291,["You can understand, and you have something","very great called vibrations."]],[3297,["But even that also, I have seen, horrible","things they do."]],[3301,["Some people went – husband, wife – went","to stay with some lady because her husband"]],[3308,["had gone to India."]],[3309,["Threw all her furniture out, all her carpets","out, everything out."]],[3314,["I said, “Why did you do it?”"]],[3316,["“Very bad vibrations.\""]],[3317,["I said, “Really?"]],[3318,["Now will you please pay for all that – for","the bad vibrations.\""]],[3322,["I mean anybody else’s things, who are you","to decide good or bad vibrations?"]],[3326,["You look after your own vibrations."]],[3329,["So they also sometimes use the vibrations","just to, sort of, express their ego."]],[3335,["So let us try on ourselves, everyone, “Am","I doing it just for ego’s sake?"]],[3345,["Am I quarreling because of ego?"]],[3348,["Am I saying ‘no’ for ego?”"]],[3351,["As far as possible, try to concede."]],[3354,["You’ll feel much better."]],[3357,["You’ll learn much more."]],[3362,["I mean, I’ve learned so many things since","I’ve been abroad, I mean, I didn’t know"]],[3368,["so many things."]],[3369,["I don’t know even now."]],[3371,["For example, I didn’t know how to operate","a TV."]],[3377,["Even now, I don’t know much about it."]],[3381,["Really."]],[3382,["I didn’t know how to operate a telephone","of a particular type."]],[3388,["So, I had to learn."]],[3392,["I had to learn how to book a ticket, which","I don’t do even now, but still I have to"]],[3400,["learn."]],[3401,["So many things I have to learn, and whatever","I can learn I would like to learn."]],[3404,["Cooking I know, but I never knew how to wash","utensils because in India they, I mean normally"]],[3413,["you have servants."]],[3414,["But I learned it – your style with fairy","liquid."]],[3419,["I had to learn."]],[3421,["There’s nothing wrong in it."]],[3424,["So one must try to learn, than to argue."]],[3428,["Ursula: In Australia, the enthusiasm and the","joy that they have!"]],[3434,["And if someone has an idea for something,","there’s just so much support for that, that"]],[3443,["they all go out to help each other."]],[3446,["It becomes a very big, collective effort."]],[3449,["Shri Mataji: But Australia, Australians are","very wise people."]],[3452,["They understand wisdom."]],[3453,["That’s what we have to be – wise, very","wise."]],[3457,["And if any Indian is there, they try to ask,","“how do you do?”"]],[3463,["Particular things, on principle as a puja","things, they’ll ask an Indian."]],[3468,["But booking the seats, never ask Indians."]],[3471,["They’re no good."]],[3473,["Cooking, kitchen, cleaning – very good."]],[3478,["Maintaining house – all right."]],[3480,["Looking after children – all right."]],[3482,["But driving a car, an Indian?"]],[3484,["Save Me."]],[3486,["I would never sit in a car which is driven","by an Indian in America."]],[3492,["Because crazy the way people drive."]],[3494,["You know this fellow won’t know how to do","it."]],[3499,["So it is just wisdom and discretion one has","to use, and not to fight."]],[3506,["It happens, I’m happy, I’ve seen this","in Australians."]],[3511,["They were declared as people of – people","who were criminals, the children of criminals."]],[3518,["They are so sensible."]],[3520,["Discretion must be used, that’s important."]],[3526,["It’s sad."]],[3528,["But it will be all right, I’m sure one day."]],[3539,["Never argue on things which doesn’t involve","any principle."]],[3542,["It’s the best way; it’s the happiest."]],[3547,["Even now, you see today it was so warm."]],[3553,["I wanted to wear a cotton sari, you see."]],[3557,["But My children said, “No, must wear this","one.\""]],[3558,["I said, “Wore it.\""]],[3559,["I was perspiring, this, that."]],[3560,["All right, doesn’t matter, what’s the","difference, perspire for a while."]],[3562,["Came out with this sari."]],[3564,["They liked it, so it’s all right to please","them."]],[3568,["Nothing, no principle is involved in it."]],[3572,["When you think about others, then you will","get rid of this problem."]],[3577,["But so many people try to preach also Sahaja","Yoga to others."]],[3584,["They should not."]],[3585,["It’s a very serious thing, they will start","teaching."]],[3588,["It need not be taught that way – then people","don’t like it."]],[3593,["But your own behavior, in your own character,","in your own responses, people should see “this"]],[3599,["person is like this.\""]],[3601,["And they should imbibe it."]],[3604,["That’s the point, I think what we lack is","discretion."]],[3614,["If you are discrete, you will learn very fast,","it’s not difficult."]],[3617,["Ursula: We still can be very judgmental of","newcomers."]],[3618,["If they have particular problems, we get all","… it’s hard."]],[3628,["Shri Mataji: The newcomers."]],[3633,["Agreed."]],[3634,["With the newcomers, you should not be harsh","with them."]],[3639,["You should be kind, you should try to understand","this thing."]],[3643,["But, you know still, I tell you sometimes","… The other day I had some boy who had come,"]],[3650,["all right?"]],[3651,["He asked Me at least twenty questions."]],[3653,["I answered them properly – this thing, that","thing."]],[3657,["And he got so pampered, he sent Me news, “I","don’t want to become Sahaja Yogi.\""]],[3669,["I mean, but for Me, anybody would box his","nose, for such an answer."]],[3677,["You see, you have to take it in a stride."]],[3683,["Situation is so bad; situation is very bad."]],[3687,["Must understand we are on a warpath, whatever","is possible, we can do it."]],[3692,["But every country has improved so much."]],[3695,["So what’s wrong here is: people don’t","want to learn; people don’t want to understand"]],[3702,["the sacrifice of giving up your ego, giving","up your decisions."]],[3708,["“All right, let’s see, let’s see.\""]],[3711,["Like that."]],[3712,["That’s why it doesn’t grow."]],[3714,["Now one thing I must say, in America if you","have My program, hall will be full, I won’t"]],[3720,["be able to enter in, and when I get out, I’ll","be pushed out like a piston."]],[3724,["I’ve seen it."]],[3725,["It’s the people are so much I don’t know","how to get in and how get out."]],[3730,["It’s terrible!"]],[3731,["And when I go away, they just disappear."]],[3735,["Because, there’s something lacking – of","course, I agree – among Sahaj Yogis, that"]],[3745,["we have to see."]],[3746,["After all, nothing special about Me as such,","I mean, they just see My photograph and come"]],[3751,["to the programs and sit down there."]],[3753,["Even if I have three days program, it goes","on increasing."]],[3757,["While there are Sahaj Yogis who may not even","be able to have one person in the hall."]],[3763,["What’s the reason?"]],[3765,["They don’t know Me."]],[3767,["All right?"]],[3768,["So there’s something lacking in us, also,","when the newcomers come in, how we treat them,"]],[3773,["we talk to them, how we appeal to them."]],[3775,["Once in awhile of course there will be somebody","who will rude."]],[3780,["Doesn’t matter."]],[3781,["But try to be nice to them."]],[3783,["On the whole I think the newcomers – I won’t","tell all these things to a newcomer if he"]],[3788,["comes."]],[3789,["If a newcomer come I say, “Oh, very nice."]],[3793,["How are you?"]],[3795,["This, that.\""]],[3796,["You see?"]],[3797,["Settle him down."]],[3799,["Any other fundamental differences you find,","you can ask Me – fundamental."]],[3806,["Yogi: I’m just little curious about, well,","future little bit."]],[3825,["Are You going to manifest Yourself in some","different way as Shri Kalki?"]],[3858,["Or are You going to sort of let the change","happen a little more gradually?"]],[3880,["Shri Mataji: Direct questions."]],[3882,["You tell Me, what should I do?"]],[3885,["Tell Me, what should I do?"]],[3887,["Any other form won’t be suitable."]],[3890,["Try any other form."]],[3892,["Take Shri Krishna’s form, You have to take","the Sudarshana and just kill off all those"]],[3898,["who don’t believe in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3902,["Is it all right?"]],[3904,["Take form of Jesus Christ."]],[3907,["Hang Yourself nicely, finish with everyone."]],[3914,["Then think of Kalki."]],[3917,["Finish everything."]],[3921,["After doing all this work, beautifully creating","all this world so beautifully, don’t you"]],[3927,["think One should manage it, try to manage","it, as far as possible?"]],[3932,["That’s My style."]],[3934,["Which one would you prefer?"]],[3938,["(Laughter from the yogis)"]],[3940,["Shri Mataji: What did he say?"]],[3943,["Voice from the crowd: He likes Your style,","Mother."]],[3947,["Shri Mataji: Aha!"]],[3948,["That’s it."]],[3949,["You see that’s what – nothing else."]],[3952,["Of course you should know that Kalki’s acting,","everybody’s acting, everybody’s acting"]],[3957,["but is on a low key, as they say."]],[3963,["One has to be very careful; it’s a very","delicate job."]],[3970,["So many are lost."]],[3972,["These gurus have taken over so many."]],[3975,["It’s a very, very delicate job."]],[3981,["All right?"]],[3982,["But if necessary, I can do something."]],[3993,["Now, any other question?"]],[3998,["What time is your dinner?"]],[4009,["Any other question?"]],[4010,["Yogi: Mother, it seems that many of us here","don’t really know about the Hamsa Chakra,"]],[4031,["in terms of understanding how it relates to","the Vishuddhi and what we can do to strengthen"]],[4039,["our Vishuddhi."]],[4040,["Shri Mataji: Hamsa Chakra stands between Vishuddhi","and Agnya as you can see clearly positioned"]],[4048,["like that."]],[4049,["But from Vishuddhi there are many nerves which","pass through Hamsas and end up here."]],[4056,["They don’t all go to the brain."]],[4059,["Or we can say that at this time, at this point,","all our reactions which are what you call"]],[4068,["reflex reactions finish off."]],[4073,["So supposing now I get some dirty smell, I’ll","close My nose like that, or if I can’t hear,"]],[4083,["I’ll just pull My ears like this; or if","I see something dirty, or if I see something"]],[4089,["jarring, My eyes will close automatically."]],[4092,["If somebody tries to put a pin through Me,","immediately I’ll … spontaneously, it’s"]],[4097,["all built in, within My system, and your system,","too, that you react with reflex action."]],[4106,["Same thing may not happen to animals."]],[4108,["Animals are different."]],[4110,["Some animals have certain reflex actions,","some have some reflex actions; but we are"]],[4116,["different and our reflex actions we are all","practically just the same."]],[4121,["There’s not much individuality."]],[4123,["There isn’t much difference in our reflex","actions."]],[4128,["At the most, with conditioning somebody might","say “Yah!”, somebody might say “Oh!”,"]],[4132,["somebody might say something – that’s","different."]],[4134,["But the reflex actions are just the same."]],[4139,["So up to the reflex action, we don’t have","to use discretion."]],[4147,["Then starts our discretion part."]],[4150,["Discretion starts when we are using these","two nadis which meet here, without going to"]],[4154,["the Agnya."]],[4155,["So when these two nadis meet here, what happens","we start seeing through our experiences."]],[4167,["First would be a reflex action, automatic","reflex action."]],[4173,["The second is when, supposing a child, if","you tell the child, “Now this is hot; don’t"]],[4179,["put your hand there”, he won’t listen."]],[4181,["Put the child."]],[4182,["With experience, he will develop reflex actions,","the conditionings of it."]],[4187,["So thus reflexes are built in within us."]],[4190,["Also, they are built in within us with, we","should say, with other conditionings like,"]],[4198,["you see, in a country supposing there’s","racialism, or in a country like ours there’s"]],[4207,["a caste system."]],[4208,["Then person react according to what they have","learned from childhood."]],[4214,["All these conditionings could be of the present","day, when you are born."]],[4220,["You could have been, yourself, born in last","life in, say, Africa."]],[4224,["Today you are born with a white skin, so you","have started sort of calling that African"]],[4231,["you have become."]],[4232,["All these conditionings can be built in, into","your Hamsa Chakra, which have come from your"]],[4239,["training of the mind, you can say the experiences","of the mind, the experiences of the society,"]],[4248,["of your knowledge, of your education, the","way you’re conditioned can be built in here"]],[4254,["– in the Hamsa Chakra."]],[4257,["And it reacts to things which has no meaning."]],[4262,["If you were … “I hate someone!”"]],[4266,["Why?"]],[4267,["Because that person wears a blue jean, or","something; or you can say a green shirt."]],[4274,["Now this is built in your mind."]],[4277,["Or sometimes this falling in love, also, comes","from the same kind of a conditioning."]],[4282,["Supposing you had met somebody who had, say,","blue eyes and was kind to you."]],[4289,["So you have fascination for a person who has","blue eyes."]],[4294,["There’s no pure idea about beauty; there’s","no pure idea of happiness; there’s no pure"]],[4300,["idea of esthetics."]],[4302,["All is condition."]],[4306,["For some people, this is beautiful; for somebody,","this is not beautiful."]],[4312,["So this is the place where these interchanges","take place between both the nadis, and here"]],[4319,["the Hamsa lies outside the path of Kundalini."]],[4325,["They sort of come out here, out of the path","of Kundalini."]],[4332,["It’s very surprising."]],[4333,["When the Kundalini moves, She goes from Vishuddhi","direct to Agnya."]],[4340,["Now, how can we improve our Hamsa then?"]],[4345,["It’s a big problem, because if our Hamsa","is sick, is over-conditioned."]],[4352,["The Kundalini cannot work on it; it just gives","up."]],[4357,["Now, so for Hamsa we use all these physical","things."]],[4363,["Like I said, put the ghee in the nose."]],[4368,["Keep it in a way that it is nourished properly."]],[4374,["Because Kundalini, if it tries to too much","attack the Hamsa, it will have problem."]],[4378,["Problem because, as it is most of our time","we spend in such a manner that your Hamsa"]],[4387,["things become – what you call the epithelial","cells, the linings – become dried out."]],[4394,["When the Kundalini rises, She may try to create","a problem more for that dryness – maybe."]],[4409,["So it is kept out, but it has an effect in","the sense that even if there is a light outside,"]],[4416,["it can fall inside."]],[4420,["So it’s not the Kundalini directly that","affects your Hamsa."]],[4425,["It is like when the Kundalini awakens, you","yourself see now that a person is, whether"]],[4437,["he is fair complexion or dark complexion,","he is a human being."]],[4442,["You reason it out and Hamsa clears up."]],[4448,["Then you see yourself that, “Oh, I’m very","egoistical.\""]],[4455,["You start seeing yourself through your Agnya,","start seeing that, “I’m so conditioned.\""]],[4462,["So you reason it out, and that’s how you","correct your conditionings."]],[4471,["This is what is Hamsa Chakra."]],[4473,["So Hamsa Chakra cannot be done if just you’re","a realized soul, but is an effect, is the"]],[4481,["symptom of your Kundalini awakening."]],[4486,["Some people think that you develop discretion","just as the Kundalini rises."]],[4494,["Is a wrong idea."]],[4497,["No."]],[4498,["That has to be deliberately seen that you","build up that discretion within yourself."]],[4503,["But once it is built – for example My discretion","is absolute, I just know what it is."]],[4511,["You see My conditioning here is absolute,","is one with the Kundalini, one with reality."]],[4518,["But for human beings, it has to be reflected","by understanding."]],[4522,["Like a child who touches something hot, then","it is hot."]],[4528,["Now this is hot, because it’s heated up."]],[4531,["So you see a person is catching on the right","heart."]],[4535,["Right."]],[4536,["He’s catching on the right heart means he’s","got a right heart, and he is suffering from"]],[4540,["such and such thing."]],[4542,["You have to see it yourself."]],[4543,["Now if you tell the person, “Are you suffering","from, say, asthma?”"]],[4547,["He says, “Yes, how do you know?”"]],[4550,["“I know it because I’ve learned it through","my finger which was burning, that’s why"]],[4555,["I know it is.\""]],[4557,["But supposing somebody has an asthma and in","that plays the part your Kundalini, you will"]],[4564,["get asthma immediately."]],[4565,["You see the point?"]],[4568,["The conditioning cannot come to us unless","and until it passes through, or sieves through,"]],[4574,["our reasoning and understanding."]],[4576,["Are you understand the point?"]],[4579,["It cannot work."]],[4582,["The reason is, it filters your collective","consciousness."]],[4588,["Otherwise, you go near a person who has AIDS,","and you become collectively conscious that"]],[4595,["he has AIDS."]],[4597,["And if you imbibe all that into you as a conditioning,","you will get it."]],[4607,["But you are separated."]],[4609,["Like person who reads a – there’s a very","nice story about this, Jerome has written."]],[4616,["Like one man, he went and read Materia Medica."]],[4619,["Went and told doctor that, “Doctor I have","all the diseases except for one, which is"]],[4626,["housewife’s knee."]],[4627,["He said, “How is it you haven’t got it?”"]],[4629,["“Because I am not a housewife.\""]],[4631,["So he got conditioned into all the diseases."]],[4636,["That’s how many people get diseases, but","thank God there’s a filter."]],[4642,["If somebody has a disease, you don’t get","it, because you can filter it."]],[4648,["But Hamsa Chakra could be affected by baddhas."]],[4652,["That’s one problem, if some baddha passes","through the nose, you might; some viruses"]],[4660,["pass through the nose, you might."]],[4664,["Affected, means it can get sick."]],[4667,["But one must understand the discrimination","between the two."]],[4671,["Say there’s a virus infection outside."]],[4675,["It can pass into your Hamsa Chakra and can","give you a problem of sinus, this, that – physical."]],[4688,["But you won’t become like a person who has","given you virus infection."]],[4692,["So there is a filter."]],[4696,["But supposing there’s a person who is very","hectic."]],[4703,["And you come in contact with that person – he’s","very hectic, so your Swadisthana can take"]],[4707,["over."]],[4708,["You can become hectic with that person."]],[4711,["Being with that person, you can become hectic."]],[4716,["But as far as the Hamsa is concerned, with","anybody you live, your Hamsa doesn’t carry"]],[4724,["the complete impact of that because there’s","filter."]],[4727,["So now, if you have to develop the discretion,","you have to learn, you have to understand."]],[4735,["It doesn’t come automatically."]],[4738,["But with children who are born realized, their","Hamsa is so developed that they know it – what"]],[4747,["is right, what is wrong."]],[4750,["Because their Hamsa is so much trained that","way, they don’t have to use much understanding."]],[4757,["But those who are now growing up, have become","now Sahaja Yogis have to know through their"]],[4765,["own experiences their Hamsa."]],[4767,["It’s a filter, also."]],[4769,["But for a child, he knows what is right, what","is wrong, because his Hamsa is developed."]],[4781,["In India, when the child is born he’s massaged","nicely."]],[4785,["Oiling is the best way to have a good Hamsa."]],[4788,["Oil his hair, oil his body, put some drops","in the nose, everything."]],[4799,["They try in the ear, in the nose and that’s","how they build up."]],[4813,["So what I have to say that physically you","should help your Hamsa Chakra by using ghee"]],[4818,["and all that, and mentally you should use","it by learning things, in experience – what"]],[4827,["to do, how to do it, how to work it out, how","to establish."]],[4844,["That is how Hamsa Chakra grows and makes you","discrete."]],[4849,["That’s why tradition is very important."]],[4854,["Tradition gives you the growth of the Hamsa","Chakra and then you go on discarding whatever"]],[4861,["is wrong out of that tradition."]],[4864,["Then again, you keep whatever is good."]],[4867,["Give it to your children, to your children,","to your children."]],[4871,["So the discretion comes to a person who is","traditionally built up better than a person"]],[4879,["who has no traditions."]],[4882,["Now, for example, this morning I was discussing","that people take, fill the wash basin and"]],[4894,["wash their face, in the West."]],[4897,["In India, we cannot conceive of it, cannot","even think of it."]],[4900,["I mean, people don’t know it can be done."]],[4904,["Because in traditional way it has come out","that if you’re washing your face and again"]],[4910,["the water goes into there, then all the dirt","is in it, again you’re using the same water."]],[4915,["So you cannot have completed."]],[4917,["So always use running water."]],[4919,["Traditionally we’ve learned it."]],[4922,["So it’s so much in our heads, in our discretion,","that we cannot even think of such a thing."]],[4929,["Simple thing that Mooladhara must be cleaned","and washed."]],[4933,["Any Indian, you take it, he knows that is,","because they must have had some problems before."]],[4939,["Whether he is in the North, he’s in the","South, East or West – ask him."]],[4946,["Auspiciousness is another thing."]],[4950,["It’s so much imbibed in the tradition."]],[4954,["But if you have a tradition, say, of doing","things which are absurd – also you can have"]],[4963,["traditions like that."]],[4964,["Like very primitive people have all kinds","of traditions which are very absurd."]],[4968,["I was told that if you go to Ladakh what they","do, somebody dies, they keep the hand of the"]],[4975,["dead person in the house all the time like","that."]],[4979,["They think that that helps."]],[4982,["But with tradition which is wrong by discarding","that, they will understand that is wrong."]],[4988,["So the more traditional you are, the ancient","you are, you learn many things."]],[4994,["Like we have seen English are, in a way, very","traditional, so they – supposing theirs"]],[5001,["a lady coming down and you are coming with","the lady, then the man will be in front – automatically."]],[5008,["He’ll just move."]],[5011,["But if she’s going up, then man will follow","her."]],[5015,["Just happens, automatically, because traditionally","they have learned that if you’re going down,"]],[5021,["the lady may fall or something, so we should","be in front."]],[5024,["So what you call as the traditional habits","of person gives you this Hamsa."]],[5032,["And these habits are built better and better","with trial and error methods."]],[5037,["And that’s how you develop it."]],[5039,["Now for people who are Sahaj Yogis, it’s","much easy to imbibe them, because if you see"]],[5043,["something, “Yes, that’s wrong – should","not do it – finished.\""]],[5046,["But you should be so clear cut about it as","you determine."]],[5049,["It works out."]],[5050,["You’re Hamsa will be all right."]],[5053,["But you tell them ten times, still they do","the same thing."]],[5056,["Then that means their Hamsa is not willing","to accept."]],[5066,["But you must nourish it, you must look after","it, you must – as I said also this kajal"]],[5071,["is also very good for Hamsa Chakra."]],[5073,["All kajal and the oil in the nose, ears – it’s","very good."]],[5080,["All acts for that."]],[5084,["Even, say, talking to another person, to talk","discretely is to say something which doesn’t"]],[5099,["lose its power of affecting that person."]],[5103,["Like if you say something very harsh, then","you should know how to neutralize it so that"]],[5109,["he retains that into himself."]],[5112,["All these discretions only come also by tradition."]],[5120,["When you find something that is futile, in","a collective way in a tradition drops out."]],[5131,["So the blessings of the tradition is great,","but greater are the blessings of your Spirit."]],[5142,["And the blessings of the Spirit are such that","through your vibrations, immediately you know"]],[5147,["this is wrong."]],[5148,["But you have to be honest about it and you","just give up."]],[5151,["You want to ascend, you want to improve your","vibrations, so for that whatever is needed"]],[5171,["you","will do."]]]);
